    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GIVE ME A WEAPON! is a new style of strategy game where your forge becomes your army. We've combined the thrilling combat of an auto-battler, the unpredictable strategy of a roguelike deck-builder, and the satisfying fun of crafting weapons by combining materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/28b92acf7dfd27322f89370bf03fefb0.avif?t=1755068357\" width=720 height=96 /></span>Before starting his war, the Demon King targeted the blacksmiths first. His plan succeeded, and every blacksmith vanished from the land. The world is full of warriors brimming with the will and courage to fight, but they have no weapons to <strong>wield</strong>, and no one to forge them! But there was one blacksmith who escaped the Demon King's curse... and that is you. Oh, last blacksmith, open your forge now and create the weapons that will save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/67b0079951691bb78c4d7952381dd37f.avif?t=1755068357\" width=720 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/f3d7d808d4e19bdf2e491b2981755895.poster.avif?t=1755068357\" width=800 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/f3d7d808d4e19bdf2e491b2981755895.webm?t=1755068357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/f3d7d808d4e19bdf2e491b2981755895.mp4?t=1755068357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 'Ember', the resource gained from battle, to purchase the 'Materials' and 'Blueprints' needed for weapon crafting. With limited resources, will you buy the item before you? Reroll the shop for higher-tier items? Or increase your resource income for the future? Every choice you make completes your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/ebb447aa8d8dcacce4ae31757e2dbf99.avif?t=1755068357\" width=720 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/a7f79f685b8977e3bbc84dc89c5196d9.poster.avif?t=1755068357\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/a7f79f685b8977e3bbc84dc89c5196d9.webm?t=1755068357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/a7f79f685b8977e3bbc84dc89c5196d9.mp4?t=1755068357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the Materials purchased from the shop according to a 'Blueprint' to create powerful weapons. Weapons of various classes each become a unique soldier, storming the battlefield. Some weapons even possess special skills, becoming your trump card to turn the tide of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/7fbba6d0f56427ddabdec1e8c260e3a8.avif?t=1755068357\" width=720 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/a48af42c118ecb83f07f5f1178074e3d.poster.avif?t=1755068357\" width=620 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/a48af42c118ecb83f07f5f1178074e3d.webm?t=1755068357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/a48af42c118ecb83f07f5f1178074e3d.mp4?t=1755068357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even an ordinary sword becomes a legend in the hands of a hero. Equip the 'Heroes' you recruit by clearing stages with weapons. The stats and skills of the Hero and weapon merge into one, creating a unit of unimaginable power. Which Hero and weapon will you combine to create your ultimate champion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/89330bb18661388e19ec95f85d52fc0b.avif?t=1755068357\" width=720 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/249e391ef740537c2a57d882e9b0ea00.poster.avif?t=1755068357\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/249e391ef740537c2a57d882e9b0ea00.webm?t=1755068357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/249e391ef740537c2a57d882e9b0ea00.mp4?t=1755068357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your journey doesn't end in defeat. Build your own winning strategy through the random rewards given after clearing each stage. Edit the pool of weapon Blueprints available in the shop, recruit Heroes, or acquire Artifacts with powerful effects. Every playthrough will become your own new legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GIVE ME A WEAPON! is a new style of strategy game where your forge becomes your army. We've combined the thrilling combat of an auto-battler, the unpredictable strategy of a roguelike deck-builder, and the satisfying fun of crafting weapons by combining materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/28b92acf7dfd27322f89370bf03fefb0.avif?t=1755068357\" width=720 height=96 /></span>Before starting his war, the Demon King targeted the blacksmiths first. His plan succeeded, and every blacksmith vanished from the land. The world is full of warriors brimming with the will and courage to fight, but they have no weapons to <strong>wield</strong>, and no one to forge them! But there was one blacksmith who escaped the Demon King's curse... and that is you. Oh, last blacksmith, open your forge now and create the weapons that will save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/67b0079951691bb78c4d7952381dd37f.avif?t=1755068357\" width=720 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/f3d7d808d4e19bdf2e491b2981755895.poster.avif?t=1755068357\" width=800 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/f3d7d808d4e19bdf2e491b2981755895.webm?t=1755068357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/f3d7d808d4e19bdf2e491b2981755895.mp4?t=1755068357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p clas