tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/a48af42c118ecb83f07f5f1178074e3d.poster.avif?t=1755068357\" width=620 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/a48af42c118ecb83f07f5f1178074e3d.webm?t=1755068357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/a48af42c118ecb83f07f5f1178074e3d.mp4?t=1755068357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even an ordinary sword becomes a legend in the hands of a hero. Equip the 'Heroes' you recruit by clearing stages with weapons. The stats and skills of the Hero and weapon merge into one, creating a unit of unimaginable power. Which Hero and weapon will you combine to create your ultimate champion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/89330bb18661388e19ec95f85d52fc0b.avif?t=1755068357\" width=720 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/249e391ef740537c2a57d882e9b0ea00.poster.avif?t=1755068357\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/249e391ef740537c2a57d882e9b0ea00.webm?t=1755068357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873560/extras/249e391ef740537c2a57d882e9b0ea00.mp4?t=1755068357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your journey doesn't end in defeat. Build your own winning strategy through the random rewards given after clearing each stage. Edit the pool of weapon Blueprints available in the shop, recruit Heroes, or acquire Artifacts with powerful effects. Every playthrough will become your own new legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
